# Documentation Reference Graph Template

Purpose:
  Documentation reference graph showing method → base class → base → API → interface relationships.
  Stored as .specdd/doc-index/ per module.

Owns: templates\specdd\doc-template.sdd

## Graph Structure

Nodes:
  - method
  - base_class
  - base
  - api
  - interface

Edges:
  method → base_class
  base_class → base
  base → api
  api → interface

## Storage

Location: .specdd/doc-index/{module}.md
Format: Markdown with reference links

## Example

Example:
  # Documentation Index: {MODULE_ID}

  ## Method → Class Graph

  - `ProcessPayment()` → `PaymentService` → `BaseService` → `POST /v1/payment`
  - `Refund()` → `PaymentService` → `BaseService` → `POST /v1/refund`

State: +
